  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Old Square Project: Promoting culture and sustainable development with</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to improve the accessibility to heritage urban settings in the Historic Centre of Havana through a pilot experience in the Old Square, through three main components: 
i)	The identification of the main areas for the interventions; 
ii)	The procurement of supplies for accessibility solutions, in order to guarantee the implementation of the main actions identified;
iii)	The implementation of the interventions prioritized in the project; 
iv)	Awareness raising and capacity building actions to ensure the full participation of the community and the local authorities.</narrative>
  </description>
